# Realm of Koh: "This land enters tapped unless you control a basic land." Bot1's only other land is a Tundra (the Plains
# and Island types, but not basic, CR 205.4a) and Bot2's Swamp is not Bot1's to count, so Bot1's Realm enters tapped on
# turn 3. Bot2's own Realm on turn 4, beside its own Swamp, enters untapped (the positive control), and taps for {B}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Tundra
Realm of Koh
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Realm of Koh
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Tundra.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Realm of Koh.Play
! Bot1.Battlefield.Realm of Koh.Activate
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Realm of Koh.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Realm of Koh.Activate(Ability: Add)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Realm of Koh.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Realm of Koh.Tapped = true
Bot2.Mana = {B}
